{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/483f5d1c89caab0e2fef396b6729c303.poster.avif?t=1772219344\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/483f5d1c89caab0e2fef396b6729c303.webm?t=1772219344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/483f5d1c89caab0e2fef396b6729c303.mp4?t=1772219344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engage in Asynchronous T<u>urn-Based Strategy</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim the map and cultivate fantastical mushrooms. Compete for dominance with whatever <strong>spores</strong> fly your way. Each tasty world (according to fungi) features a dynamic ecosystem of wind, events, resources and climate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/859c6c68137e64bdf0283088101e0b16.poster.avif?t=1772219344\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/859c6c68137e64bdf0283088101e0b16.webm?t=1772219344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/859c6c68137e64bdf0283088101e0b16.mp4?t=1772219344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Campaign (missions)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with the \u2018Ancients\u2019 in missions for knowledge. Uncover maps via a distinct fog-of-war style exploration and solve ecological challenges all the while trying to thrive on each novel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Ancient you find provides a special challenge, but you\u2019ll need to prove yourself suitable for mutualistic rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Show off your favorite Spores with companion cosmetics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and swap Skins, Caps, and Spore Staves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/8e6b57c43c781a39c90e710624758aa5.poster.avif?t=1772219344\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/8e6b57c43c781a39c90e710624758aa5.webm?t=1772219344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/8e6b57c43c781a39c90e710624758aa5.mp4?t=1772219344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends and the Computer (2-3 player matches)\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoughtful asynchronous turn mechanics provide frequent surprise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps utilize procedural features fostering innovative puzzle-like challenges; varied shapes, resources, special tiles, and dynamic events keep things fresh</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy: Spread efficient networks, concentrate on mushroom cultivation, or withhold the territory to hinder the opposition!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playable Spores: Unlock &amp; Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong>Spore </strong> has its own niche; a family of <strong>Blooms</strong>, a passive, activated abilities and general style, such as <strong>rapidly spreading</strong> mycelium network or <strong>propagating quickly</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/84b8819c96135fa15ca8cac53b66e727.poster.avif?t=1772219344\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/84b8819c96135fa15ca8cac53b66e727.webm?t=1772219344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/84b8819c96135fa15ca8cac53b66e727.mp4?t=1772219344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression System (Research)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playable <strong>Spore</strong> has secrets to unlock in its own mycelium tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your match earnings to access new Blooms, Mycology glossary entries and cosmetics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps for varied gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps utilize procedural generation to foster innovative puzzle-like challenges, including varied shapes, resources, special tiles, and dynamic events.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop extensive underground networks or concentrate on efficient mushroom cultivation and abilities!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspired by real-world mycology and ecosystems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <strong>solo indie developer</strong> and <strong>mycology enthusiast</strong> Jake Collinge, the mechanics are<strong> </strong>inspired by real mushroom ecology:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat detritus \u2018waste\u2019 material</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parasitize opponent mushrooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow above and below ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out Humus, Nitrogen and other resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to the environment: wind direction, humidity and soil quality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your underground territory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut off opponent resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and much more</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2895740?t=1772219344","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/a137b6452895abebbc1489d5f46dabf03618e89c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772219344","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/d3cf1a995bcec4bda9da3d2f6b90faf8e9c7ffc9/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772219344","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/d3cf1a995bcec4bda9da3d2f6b90faf8e9c7ffc9/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772219344","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3283660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/483f5d1c89caab0e2fef396b6729c303.poster.avif?t=1772219344\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/483f5d1c89caab0e2fef396b6729c303.webm?t=1772219344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/483f5d1c89caab0e2fef396b6729c303.mp4?t=177