19344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression System (Research)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playable <strong>Spore</strong> has secrets to unlock in its own mycelium tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your match earnings to access new Blooms, Mycology glossary entries and cosmetics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps for varied gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps utilize procedural generation to foster innovative puzzle-like challenges, including varied shapes, resources, special tiles, and dynamic events.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop extensive underground networks or concentrate on efficient mushroom cultivation and abilities!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspired by real-world mycology and ecosystems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <strong>solo indie developer</strong> and <strong>mycology enthusiast</strong> Jake Collinge, the mechanics are<strong> </strong>inspired by real mushroom ecology:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat detritus \u2018waste\u2019 material</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parasitize opponent mushrooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow above and below ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out Humus, Nitrogen and other resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to the environment: wind direction, humidity and soil quality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your underground territory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut off opponent resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and much more</p></li></ul>","developers":["Antigen Interactive Inc.","Jake Collinge"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id